-*   **Voxel Grid:** A contiguous memory block. For a linear array, index mapping is $idx = x + y \cdot res + z \cdot res^2$ [S3, S5, unofficial]. For bit-packed storage, bit index $i$ is set in `voxel_table[i / 32]` at position `31 - (i % 32)` [S5, unofficial].
